[en.IDEA_C12_DESOLATE_FARM]
Desolate farm

[en.IDEA_C12_DESOLATE_FARM_desc]
In this barren land, all you can see are scattered rocks and withered trees. No pony would ever dream of trying to grow any proper crops on this land.

[zh.IDEA_C12_DESOLATE_FARM]
萧瑟的石头农场

[zh.IDEA_C12_DESOLATE_FARM_desc]
在这块荒芜的地区，遍地的岩石和枯黄的树木是你唯一能看得到的东西。没有小马会异想天开地试图在这片土地上种植什么正经的农作物。
